  {
    "lesson_id": "036",
    "trigger_word": "distro",
    "title": "LESSON 41: THE 'DIS-' PREFIX",
    "header_color": "green",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "The prefix DIS- means APART: in all",
          "directions, or into pieces.",
          "",
          "SPREADING OUT:                        Press 1",
          "doni    → disdoni    = give → hand out",
          "sendi   → dissendi   = send → send out",
          "vastigi → disvastigi = widen → spread",
          "ĵeti    → disĵeti    = throw → scatter",
          "",
          "COMING APART:                         Press 2",
          "iri     → disiri     = go → go separate ways",
          "fali    → disfali    = fall → fall apart",
          "",
          "IN USE:                               Press 3",
          "Ni disdonis flugfoliojn en la urbo.",
          "= We handed out flyers in town.",
          "Ni disvastigu la novaĵon!",
          "= Let's spread the news!"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Doni. Disdoni. Sendi. Dissendi. Vastigi. Disvastigi. Ĵeti. Disĵeti.",
          "2": "Iri. Disiri. Fali. Disfali.",
          "3": "Ni disdonis flugfoliojn en la urbo. Ni disvastigu la novaĵon!"
        },
        "pronunciation": "Leciono tridek ses"
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "LOOK-ALIKES: not every word that starts",
          "with dis- has the prefix DIS-.",
          "",
          "THESE ARE ROOTS OF THEIR OWN:         Press 1",
          "diskuti  = to discuss",
          "distri   = to distract, to entertain",
          "distro   = distraction, entertainment",
          "disponi  = to have available",
          "distanco = distance",
          "",
          "THE TEST: take DIS- away. If what is",
          "left is a word with the SAME idea, done",
          "apart (dis-doni: doni = give), it is",
          "the prefix. If not, it is one root."
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Diskuti. Distri. Distro. Disponi. Distanco."
        }
      }
    ]
